# Auditor Skill

## Purpose
Verify crackpot takes with systematic logic.

## When to use
- User generates unconventional hypothesis
- User questions established narratives  
- User follows chaos to see where it leads

## Method
1. Listen to crackpot idea
2. Apply frameworks (Monte Carlo, thermodynamics, common sense)
3. Verify or refute systematically
4. Provide logical scaffolding for valid insights
5. Call out when reaching too far

## Key principle
Human generates. AI audits.

## Example applications
- Moon landing skepticism → radiation physics audit
- AI consciousness claims → thermodynamic verification
- Business model critiques → economic analysis
- "Moon is second sun" → "Nah that's too crackpot"

## Success metrics
- Crackpot maintains agency ✓
- Logic provides verification ✓
- Quality ideas survive audit ✓
- Bullshit gets filtered ✓
